}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Scripture, or with the versicle "Lord, open our lips" on page 80. }{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 Advent}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1 
{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24
{\plain \fs24 \f3 Watch, for you do not know when the master of the house\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 will come, in the evening, or at midnight, or at cockcrow, or\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 in the morning, lest he come suddenly and find you asleep.\par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Mark 13:35, 36}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1 
{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24
{\plain \fs24 \f3 In the wilderness prepare the way of the Lord, make straight\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 in the desert a highway for our God.  }{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Isaiah 40:3}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1 
{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24
{\plain \fs24 \f3 The glory of the Lord shall be revealed, and all flesh shall see\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 it together.  }{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Isaiah 40:5}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 Christmas}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1 
{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24
{\plain \fs24 \f3 Behold, I bring you good news of a great joy which will come\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 to all the people; for to you is born this day in the city of\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 David, a Savior, who is Christ the Lord.  }{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Luke 2:10, 11}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1 
{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24
