}{\plain \fs24 \f3 with them, and they shall be his people, and God himself will\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 be with them, and be their God.  }{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Revelation 21:3}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 Epiphany}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1 
{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24
