}{\plain \fs24 \f3 among the nations, and in every place incense shall be offered\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 to my Name, and a pure offering; for my Name shall be great\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 among the nations, says the Lord of hosts.  }{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Malachi 1:11}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 Lent}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1 
{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24
