}{\plain \fs24 \f3 is not in us, but if we confess our sins, God, who is faithful\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 and just, will forgive our sins and cleanse us from all\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 unrighteousness.  }{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 1 John 1:8, 9}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1 
{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24
