}{\plain \fs24 \f3 your God, for he is gracious and merciful, slow to anger and\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 abounding in steadfast love, and repents of evil.  }{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Joel 2:13}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1 
{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24
