}{\plain \fs24 \f3 "Father, I have sinned against heaven and before you; I am\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 no longer worthy to be called your son."  }{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Luke 15:18, 19}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1 
{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24
