}{\plain \fs24 \f3 we have rebelled against him and have not obeyed the voice\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 of the Lord our God by following his laws which he set \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 before us.  }{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Daniel 9:9, 10}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1 
{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24
