}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 to his own way; and the Lord has laid on him the iniquity of\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 us all.  }{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Isaiah 53:6}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1 
{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24
