}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 continue at once with {\u8220\'93}Lord, open our lips}{\plain \fs24 \f3 .{\u8221\'94}\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \b\f3 Confession of Sin}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 The Officiant says to the people}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1 
{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24
{\plain \fs24 \f3 Dearly beloved, we have come together in the presence of\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Almighty God our heavenly Father, to set forth his praise, to\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 hear his holy Word, and to ask, for ourselves and on behalf\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 of others, those things that are necessary for our life and our\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 salvation.  And so that we may prepare ourselves in heart and\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 mind to worship him, let us kneel in silence, and with\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 penitent and obedient hearts confess our sins, that we may\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 obtain forgiveness by his infinite goodness and mercy. \par
